  <p>I write in depth about this work — at-least-once delivery, idempotency, retry strategy, Solid Queue internals, and queue performance — and those write-ups rank on the front page of Google for the problems teams actually hit in production.</p>
  <p>When a team is fighting one of these problems, I help directly through <a href="/services">focused audits and tuning engagements</a>.</p>
